# Cloud Agent Environment Setup

Manage all tooling for this Terraform stack through `mise`. Do not install tools
individually.

## Setup

1. Check whether `mise` is installed; if not, install `mise` first.
2. Activate `mise` so its tools are on `PATH` — add `eval "$(mise activate bash)"` to `~/.bashrc`.
3. Install the required tools with `mise install` (each pinned to `latest` in `mise.toml`):
   - `terraform`
   - `just`
   - `aws` (AWS CLI v2)
   - `terraform-docs`
